<figure class="chapter-visual band-filling" data-band-filling>
  <figcaption>
    <strong>原创交互模型：能带填充、能隙与低能激发</strong>
    <span lang="en">Original interactive model: band filling, band gap, and low-energy excitations</span>
  </figcaption>

  <div class="chapter-visual__controls chapter-visual__controls--three">
    <label>
      <span>每晶胞电子数 N | Electrons per cell</span>
      <input type="range" min="0" max="4" step="1" value="2" data-band-electrons />
      <output data-band-electrons-output>2</output>
    </label>
    <label>
      <span>能隙 Eg | Gap (eV)</span>
      <input type="range" min="0" max="2" step="0.05" value="1" data-band-gap />
      <output data-band-gap-output>1.00 eV</output>
    </label>
    <label>
      <span>热能 kBT | Thermal energy (eV)</span>
      <input type="range" min="0.01" max="0.20" step="0.01" value="0.05" data-band-thermal />
      <output data-band-thermal-output>0.05 eV</output>
    </label>
  </div>

  <svg class="band-filling__plot" viewBox="0 0 620 300" role="img" aria-labelledby="band-title band-desc">
    <title id="band-title">Two-band filling model</title>
    <desc id="band-desc">Two bands, each with a capacity of two electrons per cell including spin, separated by an adjustable gap.</desc>
    <line x1="80" y1="260" x2="560" y2="260" class="plot-axis" />
    <line x1="80" y1="30" x2="80" y2="260" class="plot-axis" />
    <text x="32" y="42">E</text>
    <rect x="130" y="190" width="360" height="42" rx="8" class="band-filling__band" />
    <rect x="130" y="103" width="360" height="42" rx="8" class="band-filling__band" data-upper-band />
    <text x="500" y="217">lower band</text>
    <text x="500" y="130" data-upper-label>upper band</text>
    <line x1="130" y1="167.5" x2="490" y2="167.5" class="plot-guide" data-gap-line />
    <text x="310" y="160.5" text-anchor="middle" data-gap-label>Eg = 1.00 eV</text>
    <g data-lower-electrons aria-label="Electrons occupying the lower band"></g>
    <g data-upper-electrons aria-label="Electrons occupying the upper band"></g>
  </svg>

  <div class="chapter-visual__readout band-filling__readout" aria-live="polite">
    <strong data-band-classification>正能隙且低能带填满 | Filled lower band with a positive gap</strong>
    <span data-band-explanation>跨隙激发相对所选热尺度受到强烈抑制。</span>
    <span lang="en" data-band-explanation-en>Gap-crossing excitations are strongly suppressed on the selected thermal scale.</span>
  </div>

  <div class="chapter-visual__contract">
    <p><strong>模型：</strong>两个无色散能带，每带容量为每晶胞 2 个电子（包含两种自旋）。电子从低能带开始填充。</p>
    <p lang="en"><strong>Model:</strong> two dispersionless bands, each holding two electrons per cell including spin; electrons fill from the lower band upward.</p>
    <p><strong>验收：</strong>N = 1 时低能带部分填充；N = 2 且 Eg &gt; 0 时低能带填满、上能带为空；N = 3 时上能带部分填充。</p>
    <p lang="en"><strong>Acceptance:</strong> N = 1 partially fills the lower band; N = 2 with Eg &gt; 0 fills only the lower band; N = 3 partially fills the upper band.</p>
    <p><strong>边界：</strong>该图没有色散、态密度、相互作用、无序或声子。它说明电子计数逻辑，不能预测真实材料是金属、半导体或绝缘体。</p>
    <p lang="en"><strong>Boundary:</strong> the model omits dispersion, density of states, interactions, disorder, and phonons. It illustrates counting logic and cannot classify a real material.</p>
  </div>
</figure>

<script>
  document.querySelectorAll('[data-band-filling]').forEach((root) => {
    const electronInput = root.querySelector('[data-band-electrons]');
    const gapInput = root.querySelector('[data-band-gap]');
    const thermalInput = root.querySelector('[data-band-thermal]');
    const electronOutput = root.querySelector('[data-band-electrons-output]');
    const gapOutput = root.querySelector('[data-band-gap-output]');
    const thermalOutput = root.querySelector('[data-band-thermal-output]');
    const upperBand = root.querySelector('[data-upper-band]');
    const upperLabel = root.querySelector('[data-upper-label]');
    const gapLine = root.querySelector('[data-gap-line]');
    const gapLabel = root.querySelector('[data-gap-label]');
    const lowerElectrons = root.querySelector('[data-lower-electrons]');
    const upperElectrons = root.querySelector('[data-upper-electrons]');
    const classification = root.querySelector('[data-band-classification]');
    const explanation = root.querySelector('[data-band-explanation]');
    const explanationEn = root.querySelector('[data-band-explanation-en]');
    if (!(electronInput instanceof HTMLInputElement) || !(gapInput instanceof HTMLInputElement) || !(thermalInput instanceof HTMLInputElement)) return;
    if (!(upperBand instanceof SVGRectElement) || !(upperLabel instanceof SVGTextElement) || !(gapLine instanceof SVGLineElement) || !(gapLabel instanceof SVGTextElement)) return;
    if (!(lowerElectrons instanceof SVGGElement) || !(upperElectrons instanceof SVGGElement)) return;

    const makeDots = (group, count, y) => {
      group.replaceChildren();
      const fullDots = Math.floor(count + 1e-9);
      for (let index = 0; index < fullDots; index += 1) {
        const dot = document.createElementNS('http://www.w3.org/2000/svg', 'circle');
        dot.setAttribute('cx', String(180 + index * 46));
        dot.setAttribute('cy', String(y));
        dot.setAttribute('r', '8');
        dot.setAttribute('class', 'band-filling__electron');
        group.append(dot);
      }
    };

    const update = () => {
      const electrons = Number(electronInput.value);
      const gap = Number(gapInput.value);
      const thermal = Number(thermalInput.value);
      const lower = Math.min(electrons, 2);
      const upper = Math.max(0, electrons - 2);
      const upperY = 148 - gap * 45;
      const lineY = (upperY + 42 + 190) / 2;
      upperBand.setAttribute('y', String(upperY));
      upperLabel.setAttribute('y', String(upperY + 27));
      gapLine.setAttribute('y1', String(lineY));
      gapLine.setAttribute('y2', String(lineY));
      gapLabel.setAttribute('y', String(lineY - 7));
      gapLabel.textContent = `Eg = ${gap.toFixed(2)} eV`;
      makeDots(lowerElectrons, lower, 211);
      makeDots(upperElectrons, upper, upperY + 21);

      if (electronOutput instanceof HTMLOutputElement) electronOutput.value = electrons.toFixed(0);
      if (gapOutput instanceof HTMLOutputElement) gapOutput.value = `${gap.toFixed(2)} eV`;
      if (thermalOutput instanceof HTMLOutputElement) thermalOutput.value = `${thermal.toFixed(2)} eV`;

      const lowerPartial = electrons > 0 && electrons < 2;
      const upperPartial = electrons > 2 && electrons < 4;
      if (lowerPartial || upperPartial) {
        if (classification instanceof HTMLElement) classification.textContent = '部分填充能带 | Partially filled band';
        if (explanation instanceof HTMLElement) explanation.textContent = '费米能附近存在未占据的同带状态，单粒子图像中可产生任意低能激发。';
        if (explanationEn instanceof HTMLElement) explanationEn.textContent = 'Unoccupied states remain in the same band near the Fermi level, allowing arbitrarily low-energy single-particle excitations.';
      } else if (electrons === 2 && gap > 0) {
        if (classification instanceof HTMLElement) classification.textContent = '正能隙且低能带填满 | Filled lower band with a positive gap';
        const ratio = gap / thermal;
        if (explanation instanceof HTMLElement) explanation.textContent = ratio <= 5
          ? '跨隙激发在所选热尺度上并非极度受抑制；这对应小能隙教学情形。'
          : '跨隙激发相对所选热尺度受到强烈抑制；这对应大能隙教学情形。';
        if (explanationEn instanceof HTMLElement) explanationEn.textContent = ratio <= 5
          ? 'Gap-crossing excitations are not strongly suppressed on the selected thermal scale, representing a small-gap teaching case.'
          : 'Gap-crossing excitations are strongly suppressed on the selected thermal scale, representing a large-gap teaching case.';
      } else if (electrons === 2 && gap < 1e-9) {
        if (classification instanceof HTMLElement) classification.textContent = '满带与空带接触 | Filled and empty bands touch';
        if (explanation instanceof HTMLElement) explanation.textContent = '电子计数本身不能决定输运；还需知道接触点附近的色散、简并和相互作用。';
        if (explanationEn instanceof HTMLElement) explanationEn.textContent = 'Counting alone cannot determine transport; dispersion, degeneracy, and interactions near the touching point are required.';
      } else {
        if (classification instanceof HTMLElement) classification.textContent = '边界占据情形 | Boundary filling case';
        if (explanation instanceof HTMLElement) explanation.textContent = '空体系或两个能带都填满时，需要纳入模型之外的更高能带或粒子数约束。';
        if (explanationEn instanceof HTMLElement) explanationEn.textContent = 'An empty model or two completely filled bands requires higher bands or particle-number constraints outside this model.';
      }
    };

    electronInput.addEventListener('input', update);
    gapInput.addEventListener('input', update);
    thermalInput.addEventListener('input', update);
    update();
  });
</script>
